WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:08.712
Cora tapped her chin.

2
00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:12.794
"I think we need to find help."

3
00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:16.438
"Let's ask the parrot fish," Mo said.

4
00:00:16.439 --> 00:00:23.540
"They eat lots of algae."

5
00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:28.111
Everyone swam to the parrot fish.

6
00:00:28.112 --> 00:00:31.375
Cora explained the problem.

7
00:00:31.376 --> 00:00:36.052
"We want to help," one parrot fish said.

8
00:00:36.053 --> 00:00:40.401
"But we don't eat that kind of algae."

9
00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:44.356
Cora sighed.

10
00:00:44.357 --> 00:00:48.983
"Ask the crabs," another parrot fish said.

11
00:00:48.984 --> 00:00:54.982
"They live in Canyon Pass."

12
00:00:54.983 --> 00:01:01.623
Everyone swam to Canyon Pass.

13
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:05.777
"Whoa!" Darla said.

14
00:01:05.778 --> 00:01:09.106
"There are crabs everywhere!"

15
00:01:09.107 --> 00:01:13.510
The crabs were eating lots of seaweed.

16
00:01:13.511 --> 00:01:19.416
"Excuse me," Cora called. "We need help.

17
00:01:19.417 --> 00:01:22.510
Darla lost her family."

18
00:01:22.511 --> 00:01:26.346
A big crab stopped eating and shrugged.

19
00:01:26.347 --> 00:01:31.196
"Sorry. We haven't seen any butterfly fish."

20
00:01:31.197 --> 00:01:34.041
"No," Cora said.

21
00:01:34.042 --> 00:01:37.635
She told the crab about the algae.

22
00:01:37.636 --> 00:01:43.418
"Oh!" the crab said. "We can help with that.

23
00:01:43.419 --> 00:01:48.123
Where is this cave?"

24
00:01:48.124 --> 00:01:55.833
Cora led the crabs to the compass cave.

25
00:01:55.834 --> 00:02:04.494
The crabs got right to work.

26
00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:11.163
"Woo-hoo!" Mo yelled. "The compass is clean."

27
00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:18.302
Darla smiled. "Soon I'll find my family!"

28
00:02:18.303 --> 00:02:27.218
Cora shot her ink.

29
00:02:27.219 --> 00:02:31.224
The compass showed a net.

30
00:02:31.225 --> 00:02:34.993
"Uh-oh!" Cora gasped.

31
00:02:34.994 --> 00:02:40.938
"Your poor family got caught!"

